CHAPTER III
RIGHTS OF VICTIMS
Article 8
Every victim has the right to obtain:
a. protection;
b. information;
c. optimal services;
d. continuous handling up to the rehabilitation stage; and e. confidential handling whether individual, group or institution whether government or non-government.

